        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "1. Introduction",
          "quote": "Iron-chromium-aluminum (FeCrAl) ferritic alloys are widely used as resistance materials owing to their high electrical resistivity, excellent high-temperature oxidation resistance and cost efficiency",
